After your first Infinity, you will unlock a new tab named '''Infinity'''. Here, a tree will be shown. These are the Infinity Upgrades ('''IU'''), the first of 4 core mechanics. The upgrades cost Infinity Points (IP) in return for some essential bonuses.

== Buying First Upgrades ==
Buy your first IU [1;1]. It will multiply the first Generator, which makes '''GP''' (Generator Power) by the number of Infinities. It will also unlock a new tab, called '''Automations''', where you can automate many things, even though only 1 is available in the beginning (''Automate Purchases (Colors))''. Then it splits in two, [2;1], which increases the Common Exponent by 0.01 and [2;2], which unlocks a new automation (Automate Ascensions). Then with [3;1], it multiplies the lap speed by 1.1, and with [4;1], it multiplies the lap speed by 1.2. This table shows the rest of the upgrades.

